# QA M3, Stage 4 checkpoint respawn in the shaft (game-design.md "New
# mechanics": die in the shaft after the checkpoint -> respawn at the
# checkpoint as Normal, level reset, M-box fresh), and time-up while
# climbing. The solver route past the checkpoint (col 116, 743) to the
# path below the M-box (col 117); Resi bumps it, follows the Mozartkugel
# into the shaft (Zuckerschock at 901), jumps onto the row-23 plank and
# waits at its right end, where Pilger #8 coming down the zigzag lands
# beside her and walks away. The timer kills her: time-up at 15330 on the
# plank (death as Zuckerschock; 255 s plus the 30-frame power-up freeze).
# Respawn at the checkpoint (15390) as Normal; the M-box is fresh: she
# bumps it again and grows again (second PowerUp at 15718), so the end
# state is Zuckerschock.
# If the solver route changes, re-copy the prefix and re-check the frames.
level  = falkenstein
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
expect = dies_at frames=15330..15330 deaths=1 lives=2 event=Respawned event=CheckpointReached power=big player_x>=1880 state=playing
---
